## 1. Purpose

This artefact implements two basic data structures in C, an array-based **stack** (LIFO) and a **circular queue** (FIFO), with tests for normal and edge cases. It applies the Big O ideas from Modules 1 and 2 of the Packt course and builds on the C skills from Certificate 1.

